        "Description": "The Greece&apos;s are a family of three,  two brothers and a sister, that are all part of a cult involving kidnapping and taking innocent lives all over Italy and The United States. Romano and Vinicio Greece are working as security guards on the set of Dino Bosco&apos;s new film, while Irene Greece is spectating in the crowd. These monsters cannot go unpunished for their crimes.",
